{
  "comment": [
    "Component classes for tools/native/verify_native_runtime.py. First match wins; patterns are fnmatch globs on the",
    "map's 'library:object.obj' names, case-insensitive. guest_machine = the class exists because of the GameCube",
    "execution environment (translated code, the emulated CPU / memory, console OS and hardware models, and native",
    "bodies that serve translated callers on guest registers and guest memory). The classification of an object is a",
    "reading aid; the tool's Cpu& signature count is measured per object independently of it.",
    "Classified 2026-11-17 from the link map of cpu/opt4 (object names only); refine when an object is read."
  ],
